OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dull day with periods of
OL,6,Flight to moderate rain, which turns to
OL,7,Fhill snow, as the southwest breezes
OL,8,Fveer to the northwest during the late
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRain and hill snow clearing
OL,12,Fto leave most dry with clear spells
OL,13,Fovernight. The light winds will allow
OL,14,Ftemperatures to drop away overnight,
OL,15,Fbringing a frost for many come dawn.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FFrosty start for many. A cold
OL,18,Fday despite the morning sunshine. Most
OL,19,Fdry. Higher cloud feeding from south
OL,20,Ffor afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
